{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "framework": "vite",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": "dist",
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "trailingSlash": false,
  "crons": [
    {
      "path": "/api/cron/publish-article",
      "schedule": "0 5 * * *"
    }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/assets/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/media/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/fonts/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        },
        {
          "key": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
          "value": "*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/models/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Obrázky, ikony a PDF v public/ nemají otisk v názvu, takže nesmí být immutable. Týden na CDN se stale-while-revalidate je kompromis: revalidace na pozadí, návštěvník nikdy nečeká.",
      "source": "/(projects|og.png|favicon.svg|apple-touch-icon.png|certifikat-agentic-engineering.pdf)(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "HTML: prohlížeč revaliduje vždy, CDN si ho ale drží. Web se přestavuje jednou denně, takže s-maxage=600 + SWR znamená, že drtivá většina požadavků skončí na edge a origin se skoro nevzbudí.",
      "source": "/((?!api/).*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, s-maxage=600, stale-while-revalidate=86400"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
          "value": "nosniff"
        },
        {
          "comment": "Jediná bezpečnostní hlavička, která tu chyběla. Dva roky, subdomény i preload — web běží výhradně přes HTTPS a nikdy nebude jinak.",
          "key": "Strict-Transport-Security",
          "value": "max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload"
        },
        {
          "key": "Referrer-Policy",
          "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-Frame-Options",
          "value": "SAMEORIGIN"
        },
        {
          "key": "Permissions-Policy",
          "value": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()"
        },
        {
          "key": "Content-Security-Policy",
          "value": "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
